Z||000000||Fierochic88||08-11-2001||07:24 PM||||Hey All -<BR>    Well we've discussed this before and I figured we might as well get the ball rolling!  Anyways, Saturday August 25th my parents have offered to host PA BBQ II.  All you have to bring is Fiero fun & some type of food!  And since it's my 21st birthday - I can go buy the beer :-).  <BR>   If you would like to come let me know and I can e-mail you directions.  Let's make this the biggest PA BBQ yet!  <P>Jennifer<P>KSlish you better be coming!<P>------------------<BR>IM Username:  FieroChic88<BR>Silver 1988 GT<BR>Silver 1986 2m4<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/jenscar-sig1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Haagster||08-11-2001||08:44 PM||||Yea, I remember when I bought my first legal beer...  Happened twice, as a matter of fact.  In 1982 (Ohio), you could buy 3.2 beer at 18 until they changed the law in August (19 for beer).  I was legal for 8 months, then illegal again for 4... Not that I would buy beer illegally...<P>Unless something bad happens at work, I'll make the drive to say "Happy B-D"...||||reg||6
